{"additionalPlain":"Why Join Assist World?\n \n100% REMOTE\n$50 birthday bonus\n$200 testimonial bonus\nNO TRACKER. NO PROBLEM\n","additional":"<div><strong>Why Join Assist World?</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>100% REMOTE</div>\n<div>$50 birthday&nbsp;bonus</div>\n<div>$200 testimonial bonus</div>\n<div>NO TRACKER. NO PROBLEM</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Executive Assistant / Full- Time","department":"Sales Operations","location":"Philippines","team":"Sales Outreach / Full Time","allLocations":["Philippines","South Africa"]},"createdAt":1781284758114,"descriptionPlain":"About the Role\n\nWe are seeking a highly capable, proactive Executive Research & Operations Assistant to\nsupport an entrepreneur, investor, and business operator working across multiple companies\nand investment opportunities.\n\nThis is not a traditional diary-management or administrative assistant role. We're looking for\nsomeone who can think critically, conduct high-level research, leverage AI tools effectively, and\ntake ownership of projects with minimal supervision.\n\nThe successful candidate will become a trusted extension of the executive, helping analyse\ninvestment opportunities, review business information, support legal and commercial projects,\nand manage operational priorities.\n\nWhat You'll Be Doing\n\n● Conducting detailed company, market, and competitor research\n● Producing investment and business briefing reports\n● Reviewing legal, commercial, and corporate documents\n● Supporting due diligence and transaction processes\n● Analysing funding rounds, investor activity, and market trends\n● Preparing summaries, recommendations, and action plans\n● Managing operational projects and following them through to completion\n● Assisting with client-facing communications and virtual meetings\n● Using AI platforms to accelerate research and workflow efficiency\n● Identifying problems independently and proposing solutions\n","description":"<div><strong>About the Role</strong><br><br>We are seeking a highly capable, proactive Executive Research &amp; Operations Assistant to<br>support an entrepreneur, investor, and business operator working across multiple companies<br>and investment opportunities.<br><br>This is not a traditional diary-management or administrative assistant role. We're looking for<br>someone who can think critically, conduct high-level research, leverage AI tools effectively, and<br>take ownership of projects with minimal supervision.<br><br>The successful candidate will become a trusted extension of the executive, helping analyse<br>investment opportunities, review business information, support legal and commercial projects,<br>and manage operational priorities.<br><br>What You'll Be Doing<br><br>● Conducting detailed company, market, and competitor research<br>● Producing investment and business briefing reports<br>● Reviewing legal, commercial, and corporate documents<br>● Supporting due diligence and transaction processes<br>● Analysing funding rounds, investor activity, and market trends<br>● Preparing summaries, recommendations, and action plans<br>● Managing operational projects and following them through to completion<br>● Assisting with client-facing communications and virtual meetings<br>● Using AI platforms to accelerate research and workflow efficiency<br>● Identifying problems independently and proposing solutions</div>","id":"495484c3-d5ed-4fce-8681-8a4806e12770","lists":[{"text":"Essential Requirements","content":"<div><strong>AI &amp; Technology Skills<br></strong><br>You must be an advanced user of modern AI tools, including:<br>● Anthropic Claude<br>● OpenAI ChatGPT<br>● Google Gemini<br><br>You should understand:<br>● Advanced prompting techniques<br>● Document analysis workflows<br>● AI-assisted research<br>● Knowledge connectors and integrations<br>● Multi-source information synthesis<br>● Building repeatable AI workflows<br><br>We're looking for someone who understands that AI is more than simply entering prompts into a<br>chatbot.<br><br><strong>Research &amp; Analytical Skills</strong><br><br>You should be able to:<br>● Gather information from multiple sources<br>● Identify key insights quickly<br>● Analyse complex business situations<br>● Produce concise and actionable reports<br>● Work through ambiguity without requiring step-by-step instructions<br>Example projects may include:<br>● Analysing a potential investment opportunity<br>● Reviewing historical funding rounds<br>● Assessing competitive positioning<br>● Summarising legal documentation<br>● Producing executive-level recommendations</div>"},{"text":"Ideal Background","content":"<div>We would particularly like to hear from candidates with experience in:<br><br>● Executive assistance<br>● Venture capital<br>● Private equity<br>● Investment research<br>● Corporate finance<br>● Legal or paralegal work<br>● Business analysis<br>● Strategy consulting<br><br>Experience using platforms such as PitchBook, FactSet, Morningstar, AlphaSense, or similar<br>research tools would be highly advantageous.</div>"},{"text":"What We're Looking For","content":"<div>The ideal candidate will be:<br><br>● Highly intelligent and resourceful<br>● Exceptionally organised<br>● Comfortable working under pressure<br>● Proactive rather than reactive<br>● Curious and commercially minded<br>● Able to work independently<br>● Detail-oriented without losing sight of the bigger picture<br>● Accountable for outcomes, not just tasks<br><br>You should enjoy solving problems and be capable of taking ownership of projects from start to<br>finish</div>"}],"salaryRange":{"min":1000,"max":1400,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-month-salary"},"salaryDescription":"<div><strong>Location:</strong> Remote<br><strong>Hours: </strong>Full-Time (40 hours per week)<br><strong>Working Pattern:</strong> Flexible, with occasional availability outside standard hours at the weekends<br>when business needs require<br><strong>Salary:</strong> Competitive, dependent on experience</div>","salaryDescriptionPlain":"Location: Remote\nHours: Full-Time (40 hours per week)\nWorking Pattern: Flexible, with occasional availability outside standard hours at the weekends\nwhen business needs require\nSalary: Competitive, dependent on experience\n","text":"Executive Research & Operations Assistant (AI-Powered)","country":"PH","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"","openingPlain":"","descriptionBody":"<div><strong>About the Role</strong><br><br>We are seeking a highly capable, proactive Executive Research &amp; Operations Assistant to<br>support an entrepreneur, investor, and business operator working across multiple companies<br>and investment opportunities.<br><br>This is not a traditional diary-management or administrative assistant role. We're looking for<br>someone who can think critically, conduct high-level research, leverage AI tools effectively, and<br>take ownership of projects with minimal supervision.<br><br>The successful candidate will become a trusted extension of the executive, helping analyse<br>investment opportunities, review business information, support legal and commercial projects,<br>and manage operational priorities.<br><br>What You'll Be Doing<br><br>● Conducting detailed company, market, and competitor research<br>● Producing investment and business briefing reports<br>● Reviewing legal, commercial, and corporate documents<br>● Supporting due diligence and transaction processes<br>● Analysing funding rounds, investor activity, and market trends<br>● Preparing summaries, recommendations, and action plans<br>● Managing operational projects and following them through to completion<br>● Assisting with client-facing communications and virtual meetings<br>● Using AI platforms to accelerate research and workflow efficiency<br>● Identifying problems independently and proposing solutions</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"About the Role\n\nWe are seeking a highly capable, proactive Executive Research & Operations Assistant to\nsupport an entrepreneur, investor, and business operator working across multiple companies\nand investment opportunities.\n\nThis is not a traditional diary-management or administrative assistant role. We're looking for\nsomeone who can think critically, conduct high-level research, leverage AI tools effectively, and\ntake ownership of projects with minimal supervision.\n\nThe successful candidate will become a trusted extension of the executive, helping analyse\ninvestment opportunities, review business information, support legal and commercial projects,\nand manage operational priorities.\n\nWhat You'll Be Doing\n\n● Conducting detailed company, market, and competitor research\n● Producing investment and business briefing reports\n● Reviewing legal, commercial, and corporate documents\n● Supporting due diligence and transaction processes\n● Analysing funding rounds, investor activity, and market trends\n● Preparing summaries, recommendations, and action plans\n● Managing operational projects and following them through to completion\n● Assisting with client-facing communications and virtual meetings\n● Using AI platforms to accelerate research and workflow efficiency\n● Identifying problems independently and proposing solutions\n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/assist-world/495484c3-d5ed-4fce-8681-8a4806e12770","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/assist-world/495484c3-d5ed-4fce-8681-8a4806e12770/apply"}